        "curve": "{\"k\":[\"{\\\"p\\\":[0.0,0.0,-0.05589638650417328,-0.05589638650417328,0.0,0.2195121943950653],\\\"m\\\":0}\",\"{\\\"p\\\":[1.0,1.0,1.920803189277649,1.920803189277649,0.1788617968559265,0.0],\\\"m\\\":0}\"]}"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "option": {},
      "args": {
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "text": "こんこんと降る雪空の下、\n歌を口ずさむ精が二人。",
        "autominsec": 0,
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0045_TXT2001"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "option": {},
      "args": {
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "text": "恥じらうように瞳を閉じ、\nそれでいて気品のある歌声。",
        "autominsec": 0,
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0045_TXT2002"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "option": {},
      "args": {
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "text": "謙虚ながらも、\n広い世界への\n愛に満ちた歌声。",
        "autominsec": 0,
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0045_TXT2003"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "option": {},
      "args": {
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "text": "重なり合う歌は\n朗らかで心地よく、\n幸せの大切さを伝えるように響き渡る。",
        "autominsec": 0,
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0045_TXT2004"
      }
    },
